                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Rivet shows\nseparate branch\nvalves. A blocked\ndistrict can be",
                                  "isolated while the\nothers keep\nservice. The\nbypass does not\ncreate",
                                  "more heat. It\ngives the crew a\nway to make a\nrepair without\nmaking",
                                  "the whole city\nwait outside."
                                ],
