                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Fault card: Lodge\nbranch closed.\nFrostwick, Candy,\nand Brassworks",
                                  "branches clear.\nThe independent\nbypass is open.\nCorrect response:",
                                  "isolate the closed\nlodge branch, keep\nclear branches\nserved, and",
                                  "send the lodge a\nfault report.\nClosing everything\nrepeats the old",
                                  "failure."
                                ],
